o/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentGeneralRank.lean#L65-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrict","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrict","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentGeneralRank.lean#L60-L63","doc":"Restriction of a state to the six cell elements of the `{i,j}`\nparabolic — the trivial coset of the transversal. ","signatureChunk":0}]}